  "description": "当然，能看到星星这么好的机会，我是不会忘了做“星空消失曝光实验”的。",
  "body_html": "<p>当然，能看到星星这么好的机会，我是不会忘了做“星空消失曝光实验”的。<br><br>使用 Sony a7 III 相机，调低曝光，让木星消失时，我得到的参数是：ISO 80，光圈 f/5.6（太空照片常用光圈），快门 1/200 s。使用这个参数，我拍摄了比较亮的室内物体，对比了它们的效果。<br><br>图 1：正常曝光的楼道</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BPMQ!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facd9617a-cd57-47a5-a81f-059860e40b6b_6000x4000.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BPMQ!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facd9617a-cd57-47a5-a81f-059860e40b6b_6000x4000.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BPMQ!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facd9617a-cd57-47a5-a81f-059860e40b6b_6000x4000.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BPMQ!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facd9617a-cd57-47a5-a81f-059860e40b6b_6000x4000.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BPMQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facd9617a-cd57-47a5-a81f-059860e40b6b_6000x4000.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!BPMQ!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Facd9617a-cd57-47a5-a81f-059860e40b6b_6000x4000.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"971\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/acd9617a-cd57-47a5-a81f-059860e40b6b_6000x4000.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWa